"},{"block_id":"M050-SRC-047-SURVIVORSHIP-REVIEW-001__B00101_f7c040ba41a6","block_type":"list_item","estimated_claims":2,"parent_heading":"### Required ruling","status_markers":[],"text":"8. the After-name trigger and whether exceptional Home history can grant one;
